      "Buy at a discount that reflects realistic loss severity on repossession — auction proceeds net of towing, storage, reconditioning and fees, not retail value.",
      "Use a licensed servicer with a genuine collections and remarketing operation. Servicing quality drives returns here more than rate does.",
