      "Required physical damage insurance with the lienholder named, which protects the collateral against the casualty that would otherwise end the loan.",
      "GAP waivers, which cover the shortfall when a total loss occurs while the balance exceeds value — subject to state regulation and to the criticism that they are frequently over-sold.",
